    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stick Figure Combat</strong> is an action-packed, fast-paced battle experience where you fight hordes of relentless grey enemies to achieve the highest score possible. Test your survival skills as you face off against endless waves of foes, each more challenging than the last. Hone your abilities, unlock new weapons, and fight for dominance in an ever-intensifying combat arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling creative? Build and share your own custom maps to challenge your friends or the community! Whether you\u2019re aiming to survive as long as possible or simply having fun with your own designs, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Waves of Combat:</strong> Fight through increasingly difficult enemies in a test of skill and endurance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Upgrades:</strong> Discover powerful tools to help you survive longer and defeat tougher enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive Leaderboards:</strong> See how you rank against other players and strive to reach the top of the leaderboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Editor: </strong>Create your own swarm or zombie mode levels to battle the way you want! Make EXP farms to farm kills &amp; EXP while AFK (away)! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive. Fight. Create. The battle never ends in <i>Stick Figure Combat</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version adds more excitement, clarity, and a focus on the game\u2019s key features, helping it stand out more to potential players on Steam!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stick Figure Combat</strong> is an action-packed, fast-paced battle experience where you fight hordes of relentless grey enemies to achieve the highest score possible. Test your survival skills as you face off against endless waves of foes, each more challenging than the last. Hone your abilities, unlock new weapons, and fight for dominance in an ever-intensifying combat arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling creative? Build and share your own custom maps to challenge your friends or the community! Whether you\u2019re aiming to survive as long as possible or simply having fun with your own designs, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Waves of Combat:</strong> Fight through increasingly difficult enemies in a test of skill and endurance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Upgrades:</strong> Discover powerful tools to help you survive longer and defeat tougher enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive Leaderboards:</strong> See how you rank against other players and strive to reach the top of the leaderboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Editor: </strong>Create your own swarm or zombie mode levels to battle the way you want! Make EXP farms to farm kills &amp; EXP while AFK (away)! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive. Fight. Create. The battle never ends in <i>Stick Figure Combat</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version adds more excitement, clarity, and a focus on the game\u2019s key features, helping it stand out more to potential players on Steam!</p>",
    "short_description": "Stick Figure Combat is a game where you fight other stick figures to secure the highest score possible. Try to survive as long as possible against endless hordes of grey enemies! Or create your own map and have your own fun!",
